[Unit]
Description=RANDOM look-alikes of the likes (twelve windows of thirty minutes a day, Paris — the owner, 7 October, eight before — each clear of the dig's, the drift's and the fingerprints' runs, after the night site check, and set just after a previews' run can end — they start at :12 and :42 and last twenty minutes at most; the 07:15 window of 7 October waited fifteen minutes on their lock and gave up: the small model judges what the searches around each like bring, alone on the machine)

